Background music goes in this folder - see clusterfun-client/docs/music.md.

The audio itself is deliberately not in git: it is large and it is not source.  This
file only exists so the folder does, because conan.json copies hosted_content into
every deploy and the copy would fail on a fresh clone with no folder here.

Drop .m4a files in and they show up - the manifest at /music/music.json is generated
from whatever is present, so there is nothing else to edit.
